  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Integrated Program, Mopti region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general and long-term goal for the project is to improve the social and health situation of women in the intervention zone. This is done through the reduction of the practice of the FGM until the complete abandonment of this practice and through a general improvement of living conditions for the women and the households in particular. The project objective is to stop the practice of female circumcision, to ensure that the rights of girls are protected and contribute to the welfare of the pop</narrative>
  </description>
